  <p id="c-liangshu-016-zhangchuyuan:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-016-zhangchuyuan:p001:m0000" ref="ant_dk4_dds">稷</persName>長女<persName id="c-liangshu-016-zhangchuyuan:p001:m0003" ref="ant_dk4_dds_A">楚瑗</persName>，適會稽孔氏，無子歸宗。至<persName id="c-liangshu-016-zhangchuyuan:p001:m0018" ref="ant_dk4_dds">稷</persName>見害，女以身蔽刃，先父卒。</p>
